  "details": "Same as the following open-beta post, and this issue still remains on latest live (1149).\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/open-beta/p/1144-quest-crashes-on-launch-with-disconnected-controller\nVRChat crashes after appearing VRChat App banner when you connect only one controller (either left or right one).\nYou can easily reproduce this problem launching VRChat with one of the controllers disconnected.\nThis issue is fatal because the app crashes without any prompts and many quest user have a controller problem so not a few people suffer from the issue now.\nAs a supplement, disconnecting a controller is OK after a successful login.",
